data

# Compiled bytecode from the developer's working tree. Two reasons: it makes
# the image contents depend on whoever ran the build (the digests we publish
# have to be reproducible), and a DRY_RUN_ONLY build deletes .py files, so a
# copied __pycache__ would leave the stripped modules' bytecode behind.
__pycache__
*.pyc
*.pyo

wcc-frontend/node_modules
wcc-frontend/dist

*.pdf
*.zip
*.webp
.DS_Store

tests
